7,"Tibetan Ethnic Minority-Yunnan Tour, Yunnan Travel, Yunnan Travel...",https://www.yunnanexploration.com/tibetan-ethnic-minority.html,"In 1951, Tibet was peacefully liberated. Tibetans have their own unique language and script. The Tibetan language belongs to the Tibeto-Burman branch of the Sino-Tibetan language family, with three main dialects: Ü-Tsang (卫藏), Kham (康), and Amdo (安多).",Kucong,Sino-Tibetan
